name=Safe Login
poster=poster.png
description=Ever got mauled to death right after the login in a multiplayer server without having the time to realize what was going on? Or even before being able to see anything at all?
description=This mod provides a safe login experience by making players temporarily invisible to zombies on login/game start. It will give you some invisibility time to escape, simulating that while you were offline your character didn't simply stand there waiting for the zombies to surround them.
description=
description=How  does the mod work?
description=- Upon entering the game a timer will start (configurable in the sandbox options). The player is invisible to zombies
description=- If the player moves the first timer will be replaced by a different one
description=- If any of the timer will elapse the player will be made visible
description=- If the player attacks (even without hitting anything) it will be made visible
id=SafeLogin
